Maximum size in bytes of unparsed data collected per query before being inserted\n\nCloud default value: `104857600` (100 MiB).\n\n**Type:** `UInt64`\n\n**Default:** `10485760`\n\n**History**\n\n- **24.2** — the default value changed from `1000000` to `10485760`. The previous value appeared to be too small.
Alias of `os_threads_nice_value_query`.\n\n**Introduced in:** v25.9\n\n**History**\n\n- **25.9** — introduced with the default value `0`. New setting, with `os_thread_priority` as an alias of it.
Alias of `max_insert_block_size`.\n\n**Introduced in:** v26.1\n\n**History**\n\n- **26.1** — introduced with the default value `1048449`. Added the alias `max_insert_block_size_rows`.
